Subject: [PATCH 2/3] test(sentiment): cover SentimentAggregator +
 SentimentEngine (43% -> 99%)

- Add tests/sentiment/test_engine.py: 30 tests covering
  sgr/sentiment/engine.py.
- SentimentAggregator (pure aggregation logic: window filtering,
  confidence weighting, rolling-window pruning, source breakdown) is
  tested directly with real signals, no mocking needed.
- SentimentEngine (start/stop, get_sentiment cache hit/miss/error
  paths, _process_article, _news_loop/_macro_loop happy-path +
  swallowed-error + CancelledError-exit paths) is tested with
  AsyncMock/MagicMock doubles for NewsFetcher, MacroEventMonitor and
  Redis, matching the established pattern in
  tests/unit/test_event_bus.py for modules requiring external
  infrastructure (Redis, external news/macro APIs).
- No production code changes. Full suite verified green: 1141
  passed, 9 skipped, 0 failed. Coverage 90.96% -> 91.98%. ruff
  unchanged (22, pre-existing). mypy sgr/ unchanged (118,
  pre-existing).
